D{i_1;a_1} = ε{;a_1} - ε{i_1;}

=================================================
Plain Text
=================================================
Declare index i_1
Declare index a_1

Declare tensor D[i_1, a_1]
Declare tensor ε[i_1]
Declare tensor ε[a_1]
Declare tensor 𝟙[i_1]
Declare tensor 𝟙[a_1]

Create D[i_1, a_1] and initialize to zero
Load ε[i_1]
Create 𝟙[a_1] and fill with ones
Compute D[i_1, a_1] += -1 ε[i_1] 𝟙[a_1]
Unload 𝟙[a_1]
Unload ε[i_1]
Load ε[a_1]
Create 𝟙[i_1] and fill with ones
Compute D[i_1, a_1] += ε[a_1] 𝟙[i_1]
Unload 𝟙[i_1]
Unload ε[a_1]
Persist D[i_1, a_1]

